"notes": "Cohort = total population (総人口), both sexes, 5-year bands 25-29 + 30-34 + 35-39, in thousands (as published). Reference date October 1 each year; each annual value repeated across that year's 4 quarters (annual-step). Stitched across three official 人口推計 vintages at census-benchmark years; overlap 2020 = 20596 thousand matches across vintages. Demographic cycle: 団塊 (baby-boom) peak ~1979-80 (~29.0M), trough ~1992-93 (~24.3M), 団塊ジュニア echo secondary peak ~2003-04 (~27.3M), steady decline to 2024 (~19.8M). No nulls; every year sourced."
